# Bone Shards with two creatures to choose from: the sacrifice is a real choice, so alice is asked it.
# Alice (`human…`, seat 0) holds Bone Shards and nothing else, so its cost can only be the sacrifice (no
# card is left to discard). One Swamp pays its {B}. Her Grizzly Bears and Llanowar Elves can each be the
# sacrifice; bob's Hill Giant is the target. Forge asks the target first and the sacrifice after it
# (rule 601.2c before 601.2h). `bo-bone-shards` is the same with the Bears alone.
